<title>JAPAN: Japan likely to auction T-bills Thursday - sources.</title>
<headline>Japan likely to auction T-bills Thursday - sources.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of Finance (MOF) is likely to offer Treasury bills (T-bills) in an auction on Thursday, market sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The issue is likely to consist of six-month T-bills and the size of the offer is expected to be around 1.3 trillion yen, bond traders said.</p>
